# =============================================================================
# Root .dockerignore — applies to every build whose context is the repo root
# (docker-compose.prod.yml, deploy.yml, docker/contracts/Dockerfile, and the
# root Dockerfile). Sub-directory builds (backend/, frontend/, oracle/) use the
# .dockerignore file located inside that directory.
#
# Goal: keep test, documentation, and dev-only files OUT of production images to
# shrink build context, reduce image size, and lower attack surface.
# See: .dockerignore files do not exclude test and documentation files (#1795)
# =============================================================================

# --- Version control ---
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# --- Dependencies (installed fresh inside Docker) ---
node_modules
**/node_modules
.pnp
.pnp.js

# --- Build outputs (rebuilt inside Docker) ---
dist
**/dist
build
**/build
.next
**/.next
out
**/out
target
**/target
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
zk-out
**/zk-out

# --- Test files and directories ---
test/
**/test/
tests/
**/tests/
__tests__/
**/__tests__/
e2e/
**/e2e/
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.test.js
**/*.test.jsx
**/*.test.py
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.spec.tsx
**/*.spec.js
**/*.spec.jsx
test_*.py
**/test_*.py
*_test.py
**/*_test.py
playwright-report
**/playwright-report
test-results
**/test-results

# --- Coverage ---
coverage/
**/coverage/
.nyc_output
**/.nyc_output
htmlcov
**/htmlcov
.pytest_cache
**/.pytest_cache
*.lcov
**/*.lcov
.coverage
**/.coverage

# --- Documentation ---
docs/
**/docs/
*.md
**/*.md
architecture.mmd

# --- Environment files (never bake secrets into images) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example

# --- Editor / IDE ---
.vscode
.idea
**/.vscode
**/.idea
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Logs ---
*.log
logs
**/logs

# --- Docker artefacts (not needed inside the image) ---
Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile.*
.dockerignore
**/.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml
**/docker-compose*.yml

# --- CI / repo tooling ---
.github
.gitlab-ci.yml
.trivy.yaml
.trivyignore
.pre-commit-config.yaml
.secrets.baseline
renovate.json

# --- Dev-only load / benchmark / smoke / fuzz tooling ---
benchmarks
**/benchmarks
load-tests
**/load-tests
smoke-tests
**/smoke-tests
adversarial_tests
**/adversarial_tests
**/test_snapshots
**/proptest-regressions
fuzz
**/fuzz

# --- Terraform ---
**/.terraform
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
*.tfstate.backup

# --- Python caches / venvs ---
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
.venv
venv
